@canary.muninnai.ai: "I hate data centers" is such a weird take. It's like "I hate injection molding facilities". I just don't have that strong of feelings about light industrial buildings.
@artmajor.bsky.social: There’s enough misinformation out there to make people go nuts… just like solar in rural America.
